    "whatItTellsYou": "Crossing the threshold triggers the all-or-none upstroke; the peak height reflects sodium-channel drive, spike width reflects repolarization speed, and the depth of the after-hyperpolarization sets how soon the cell can fire again. A broadened spike or missing after-hyperpolarization signals altered channel function.",
